his difficulty by using a conditional random field model with more expressive potentials, taking advantage of recent results enabling inference of fully connected models almost in real-time. Parameters of the method are learned automatically using a structured output support vector machine, a supervised technique widely used for structured prediction in a number of machine learning applications. Our method, trained with state of the art features, is evaluated both quantitatively and qualitatively on four publicly available data sets: DRIVE, STARE, CHASEDB1 and HRF. Additionally, a quantitative comparison with respect to other strategies is included. The experimental results show that this approach outperforms other techniques when evaluated in terms of sensitivity, F1-score, G-mean and Matthews correlation coefficient. Additionally,",0,31,"2016-09-20T12:37:36.000Z",1,11,32,0,0,[],15,0,"ignaciorlando/fundus-vessel-segmentation-tbme",47,15,4,0,0,0,"2019-06-25T10:13:51.000Z",null,null,""],["github:iluhaputs/dicomproccessor",0,"IluhaPuts/DicomProccessor","https://github.com/IluhaPuts/DicomProccessor","",0,32,"2016-09-22T05:29:40.000Z",8,7,33,0,0,[],9,6,"IluhaPuts/DicomProccessor",0,0,0,0,2,0,"2016-09-22T05:29:40.000Z",null,null,""],["github:inference-org/voxppdec",0,"inference-org/voxppdec","https://github.com/inference-org/voxppdec","Models fMRI voxel pattern of responses to a stimulus feature with a probabilistic population code and reconstruct Bayesian posterior probability distribution over the stimulus feature",0,33,"2016-09-10T18:08:02.000Z",9,5,34,0,0,[],7,2,"inference-org/voxppdec",0,0,0,2,0,0,"2016-11-02T00:23:18.000Z",null,null,""],["github:jagadeesh09/synapse",0,"jagadeesh09/Synapse","https://github.com/jagadeesh09/Synapse","Related to Dream Mammography Challenge Competition",0,34,"2016-09-25T16:08:21.000Z",5,4,35,0,0,[],6,0,"jagadeesh09/Synapse",0,0,0,0,4,0,"2016-11-09T14:29:49.000Z",null,null,""],["github:jeffmacinnes/recordphysio",0,"jeffmacinnes/recordPhy